      "The page says you are not done. An email with a link is on its way. It can take a while.",
      "Open the link within 24 hours. After that you must ask for a new one.",
      "Fill in the full form behind the link. The details should match the listing you want removed. Solve the second CAPTCHA and submit.",
      "A confirmation page says the request was received and is being processed. A confirmation email follows. The site asks you to allow 3 days.",
      "Watch your inbox afterwards. The broker may send a later email that refuses the request."
